        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/golden/mission_gecko/scene_gecko_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 2486a862-49f0-43cc-b0d3-58b845c4736e).Image",
        "Description": "You work as a waiter in the Burj Al-Ghazali. Due to lack of staff you have been ordered to tend all 4 bars of floor 180. This includes Atrium bar, Black Gold Bar, the VIP bar and the balcony bar. You are sick of the success of the bars, so decide to poison drinks so that customers don&apos;t come back due to bad reputation.\r\r1. Attend the staff briefing (yes, it&apos;s already the fourth on this day).\r2. Collect poisons. Don&apos;t forget, you have some in your locker.\r3. Serve the customers some drinks.",
